. 
. * 3.2.1 Comparison of Mean Age of Individuals:

. 
. *----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*

. 
. 
. 
. *    3.2.1.1 mean age of rural individuals is equal to that of urban individuals

. 
. ttest S4C6, by(Region)

{txt}Two-sample t test with equal variances
{hline 9}{c TT}{hline 68}
   Group{col 10}{c |}{col 16}Obs{col 27}Mean{col 35}Std. Err.{col 47}Std. Dev.{col 59}[95% Conf. Interval]
{hline 9}{c +}{hline 68}
   Rural {c |}{res}{col 12}  6,550{col 22} 20.30382{col 34} .2102798{col 46} 17.01838{col 58}  19.8916{col 70} 20.71603
   {txt}Urban {c |}{res}{col 12}  3,102{col 22} 21.88943{col 34} .3071489{col 46} 17.10684{col 58} 21.28719{col 70} 22.49166
{txt}{hline 9}{c +}{hline 68}
combined {c |}{res}{col 12}  9,652{col 22} 20.81341{col 34} .1736691{col 46} 17.06205{col 58} 20.47298{col 70} 21.15383
{txt}{hline 9}{c +}{hline 68}
    diff {c |}{res}{col 22}-1.585609{col 34}  .371545{col 58}-2.313915{col 70}-.8573033
{txt}{hline 9}{c BT}{hline 68}
    diff = mean({res}Rural{txt}) - mean({res}Urban{txt})                              t = {res} -4.2676
{txt}Ho: diff = 0                                     degrees of freedom = {res}    9650

    {txt}Ha: diff < 0                 Ha: diff != 0                 Ha: diff > 0
 Pr(T < t) = {res}0.0000         {txt}Pr(|T| > |t|) = {res}0.0000          {txt}Pr(T > t) = {res}1.0000

{com}. 
. 
. 
